[
  {
    "content_id": "10059001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;作上帝和主耶穌基督僕人的雅各請散住十二個支派之人的安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄們，你們落在百般試煉中，都要以為大喜樂；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因為知道你們的信心經過試驗，就生忍耐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;但忍耐也當成功，使你們成全、完備，毫無缺欠。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們中間若有缺少智慧的，應當求那厚賜與眾人、也不斥責人的上帝，主就必賜給他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;只要憑着信心求，一點不疑惑；因為那疑惑的人，就像海中的波浪，被風吹動翻騰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;這樣的人不要想從主那裏得甚麼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;心懷二意的人，在他一切所行的路上都沒有定見。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;卑微的弟兄升高，就該喜樂；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;富足的降卑，也該如此；因為他必要過去，如同草上的花一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;太陽出來，熱風颳起，草就枯乾，花也凋謝，美容就消沒了；那富足的人，在他所行的事上也要這樣衰殘。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;忍受試探的人是有福的，因為他經過試驗以後，必得生命的冠冕；這是主應許給那些愛他之人的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;人被試探，不可說：「我是被上帝試探」；因為上帝不能被惡試探，他也不試探人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;但各人被試探，乃是被自己的私慾牽引誘惑的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;私慾既懷了胎，就生出罪來；罪既長成，就生出死來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我親愛的弟兄們，不要看錯了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;各樣美善的恩賜和各樣全備的賞賜都是從上頭來的，從眾光之父那裏降下來的；在他並沒有改變，也沒有轉動的影兒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他按自己的旨意，用真道生了我們，叫我們在他所造的萬物中好像初熟的果子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我親愛的弟兄們，這是你們所知道的。但你們各人要快快地聽，慢慢地說，慢慢地動怒，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;因為人的怒氣並不成就上帝的義。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;所以，你們要脫去一切的污穢和盈餘的邪惡，存溫柔的心領受那所栽種的道，就是能救你們靈魂的道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;只是你們要行道，不要單單聽道，自己欺哄自己。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;因為聽道而不行道的，就像人對着鏡子看自己本來的面目，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;看見，走後，隨即忘了他的相貌如何。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;惟有詳細察看那全備、使人自由之律法的，並且時常如此，這人既不是聽了就忘，乃是實在行出來，就在他所行的事上必然得福。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001026",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;若有人自以為虔誠，卻不勒住他的舌頭，反欺哄自己的心，這人的虔誠是虛的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 1:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001027",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;在上帝我們的父面前，那清潔沒有玷污的虔誠，就是看顧在患難中的孤兒寡婦，並且保守自己不沾染世俗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄們，你們信奉我們榮耀的主耶穌基督，便不可按着外貌待人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;若有一個人帶着金戒指，穿着華美衣服，進你們的會堂去；又有一個窮人穿着骯髒衣服也進去；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你們就重看那穿華美衣服的人，說：「請坐在這好位上」；又對那窮人說：「你站在那裏」，或「坐在我腳凳下邊。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;這豈不是你們偏心待人，用惡意斷定人嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我親愛的弟兄們，請聽，上帝豈不是揀選了世上的貧窮人，叫他們在信上富足，並承受他所應許給那些愛他之人的國嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你們反倒羞辱貧窮人。那富足人豈不是欺壓你們、拉你們到公堂去嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;他們不是褻瀆你們所敬奉的尊名嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;經上記着說：「要愛人如己。」你們若全守這至尊的律法才是好的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;但你們若按外貌待人，便是犯罪，被律法定為犯法的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因為凡遵守全律法的，只在一條上跌倒，他就是犯了眾條。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;原來那說「不可姦淫」的，也說「不可殺人」；你就是不姦淫，卻殺人，仍是成了犯律法的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你們既然要按使人自由的律法受審判，就該照這律法說話行事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;因為那不憐憫人的，也要受無憐憫的審判；憐憫原是向審判誇勝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄們，若有人說自己有信心，卻沒有行為，有甚麼益處呢？這信心能救他嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;若是弟兄或是姊妹，赤身露體，又缺了日用的飲食；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你們中間有人對他們說：「平平安安地去吧！願你們穿得暖，吃得飽」，卻不給他們身體所需用的，這有甚麼益處呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;這樣，信心若沒有行為就是死的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;必有人說：「你有信心，我有行為；你將你沒有行為的信心指給我看，我便藉着我的行為，將我的信心指給你看。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;你信上帝只有一位，你信的不錯；鬼魔也信，卻是戰驚。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;虛浮的人哪，你願意知道沒有行為的信心是死的嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我們的祖宗亞伯拉罕把他兒子以撒獻在壇上，豈不是因行為稱義嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;可見，信心是與他的行為並行，而且信心因着行為才得成全。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;這就應驗經上所說：「亞伯拉罕信上帝，這就算為他的義。」他又得稱為上帝的朋友。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;這樣看來，人稱義是因着行為，不是單因着信。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;妓女喇合接待使者，又放他們從別的路上出去，不也是一樣因行為稱義嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 2:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002026",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;身體沒有靈魂是死的，信心沒有行為也是死的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄們，不要多人作師傅，因為曉得我們要受更重的判斷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;原來我們在許多事上都有過失；若有人在話語上沒有過失，他就是完全人，也能勒住自己的全身。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我們若把嚼環放在馬嘴裏，叫牠順服，就能調動牠的全身。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;看哪，船隻雖然甚大，又被大風催逼，只用小小的舵，就隨着掌舵的意思轉動。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;這樣，舌頭在百體裏也是最小的，卻能說大話。 看哪，最小的火能點着最大的樹林。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;舌頭就是火，在我們百體中，舌頭是個罪惡的世界，能污穢全身，也能把生命的輪子點起來，並且是從地獄裏點着的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;各類的走獸、飛禽、昆蟲、水族，本來都可以制伏，也已經被人制伏了；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;惟獨舌頭沒有人能制伏，是不止息的惡物，滿了害死人的毒氣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我們用舌頭頌讚那為主、為父的，又用舌頭咒詛那照着上帝形像被造的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;頌讚和咒詛從一個口裏出來！我的弟兄們，這是不應當的！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;泉源從一個眼裏能發出甜苦兩樣的水嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄們，無花果樹能生橄欖嗎？葡萄樹能結無花果嗎？鹹水裏也不能發出甜水來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你們中間誰是有智慧有見識的呢？他就當在智慧的溫柔上顯出他的善行來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你們心裏若懷着苦毒的嫉妒和紛爭，就不可自誇，也不可說謊話抵擋真道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;這樣的智慧不是從上頭來的，乃是屬地的，屬情慾的，屬鬼魔的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;在何處有嫉妒、紛爭，就在何處有擾亂和各樣的壞事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;惟獨從上頭來的智慧，先是清潔，後是和平，溫良柔順，滿有憐憫，多結善果，沒有偏見，沒有假冒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;並且使人和平的，是用和平所栽種的義果。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你們中間的爭戰鬥毆是從哪裏來的呢？不是從你們百體中戰鬥之私慾來的嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你們貪戀，還是得不着；你們殺害嫉妒，又鬥毆爭戰，也不能得。你們得不着，是因為你們不求。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你們求也得不着，是因為你們妄求，要浪費在你們的宴樂中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你們這些淫亂的人哪，豈不知與世俗為友就是與上帝為敵嗎？所以凡想要與世俗為友的，就是與上帝為敵了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們想經上所說是徒然的嗎？上帝所賜、住在我們裏面的靈，是戀愛至於嫉妒嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;但他賜更多的恩典，所以經上說： 上帝阻擋驕傲的人， 賜恩給謙卑的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;故此，你們要順服上帝。務要抵擋魔鬼，魔鬼就必離開你們逃跑了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你們親近上帝，上帝就必親近你們。有罪的人哪，要潔淨你們的手！心懷二意的人哪，要清潔你們的心！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你們要愁苦、悲哀、哭泣，將喜笑變作悲哀，歡樂變作愁悶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;務要在主面前自卑，主就必叫你們升高。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;弟兄們，你們不可彼此批評。人若批評弟兄，論斷弟兄，就是批評律法，論斷律法。你若論斷律法，就不是遵行律法，乃是判斷人的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;設立律法和判斷人的，只有一位，就是那能救人也能滅人的。你是誰，竟敢論斷別人呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;嗐！你們有話說：「今天明天我們要往某城裏去，在那裏住一年，做買賣得利。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;其實明天如何，你們還不知道。你們的生命是甚麼呢？你們原來是一片雲霧，出現少時就不見了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你們只當說：「主若願意，我們就可以活着，也可以做這事，或做那事。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;現今你們竟以張狂誇口；凡這樣誇口都是惡的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;人若知道行善，卻不去行，這就是他的罪了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;嗐！你們這些富足人哪，應當哭泣、號咷，因為將有苦難臨到你們身上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你們的財物壞了，衣服也被蟲子咬了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你們的金銀都長了銹；那銹要證明你們的不是，又要吃你們的肉，如同火燒。你們在這末世只知積攢錢財。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;工人給你們收割莊稼，你們虧欠他們的工錢，這工錢有聲音呼叫，並且那收割之人的冤聲已經入了萬軍之主的耳了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們在世上享美福，好宴樂，當宰殺的日子竟嬌養你們的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你們定了義人的罪，把他殺害，他也不抵擋你們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;弟兄們哪，你們要忍耐，直到主來。看哪，農夫忍耐等候地裏寶貴的出產，直到得了秋雨春雨。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你們也當忍耐，堅固你們的心，因為主來的日子近了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;弟兄們，你們不要彼此埋怨，免得受審判。看哪，審判的主站在門前了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;弟兄們，你們要把那先前奉主名說話的眾先知當作能受苦能忍耐的榜樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;那先前忍耐的人，我們稱他們是有福的。你們聽見過約伯的忍耐，也知道主給他的結局，明顯主是滿心憐憫，大有慈悲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄們，最要緊的是不可起誓；不可指着天起誓，也不可指着地起誓，無論何誓都不可起。你們說話，是，就說是；不是，就說不是，免得你們落在審判之下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你們中間有受苦的呢，他就該禱告；有喜樂的呢，他就該歌頌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你們中間有病了的呢，他就該請教會的長老來；他們可以奉主的名用油抹他，為他禱告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;出於信心的祈禱要救那病人，主必叫他起來；他若犯了罪，也必蒙赦免。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;所以你們要彼此認罪，互相代求，使你們可以得醫治。義人祈禱所發的力量是大有功效的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;以利亞與我們是一樣性情的人，他懇切禱告，求不要下雨，雨就三年零六個月不下在地上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他又禱告，天就降下雨來，地也生出土產。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄們，你們中間若有失迷真道的，有人使他回轉，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各書 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;這人該知道：叫一個罪人從迷路上轉回便是救一個靈魂不死，並且遮蓋許多的罪。</p>"
  }
]